OL,3,GNEWSANew telephone support service for
OL,4,Aparents
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and carers of under 25s in
OL,7,FNorth East Lincolnshire are now able to
OL,8,Freceive advice through a new telephone
OL,9,Fhelpline.
OL,11,FNorth East Lincolnshire Council said
OL,12,Fthe service provided families with an
OL,13,Fopportunity to talk directly with the
OL,14,Fcommunity educational psychology team.
OL,16,FService director Jennifer Steel said
OL,17,Fthe team was on hand to offer an
OL,18,F"informal opportunity" to discuss
OL,19,Fconcerns and provide information.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
